+  // the same drawing) shares one bitmap with every view of the same name and size, and a view keeps
+  // its bitmap while it is off the screen. A shared bitmap is never recycled: other views draw it.
+  // The cache is a share of the app's memory (a sixth, as image caches do; at least 24 MB, at most
+  // 128 MB) and is emptied when the system runs low on memory (onTrimMemory): a cheap phone keeps fewer pictures instead of being closed in the background.
+  private static final String SHARED_PREFIX = "svgc:";
+  private static final int SHARED_MIN = 24 * 1024 * 1024;
+  private static final int SHARED_MAX = 128 * 1024 * 1024;
+  private static final LruCache<String, Bitmap> SHARED =
